; Exports of the VR EyeCapture SteamVR proxy openvr_api.dll: every export of Valve's openvr_api.dll 1.13.10
; (dumpbin /exports, 23 names) as explicit trampolines (proxy_exports.cpp, accessor_stubs.asm), plus our own
; EyeCaptureProxyVersion. No .def forwarders: the real DLL is loaded by full path at the first call.
; Deliberately the 1.13.x set: newer Valve DLLs (2.x, e.g. 2.15.6) export a SUBSET of these 23 names, older games still
; import the extra ones (VRCompositorSystemInternal, VRDriverDirectInternal, VRRenderModelsInternal, VRSceneGraph,
; VRTrackedCameraInternal); the tray refuses to enable a game whose DLL exports a name missing here (MissingExports).
LIBRARY openvr_api
EXPORTS
    LiquidVR
    VRCompositorSystemInternal
    VRControlPanel
    VRDriverDirectInternal
    VRHeadsetView
    VRPaths
    VRRenderModelsInternal
    VRSceneGraph
    VRTrackedCameraInternal
    VRVirtualDisplay
    VR_GetGenericInterface
    VR_GetInitToken
    VR_GetRuntimePath
    VR_GetStringForHmdError
    VR_GetVRInitErrorAsEnglishDescription
    VR_GetVRInitErrorAsSymbol
    VR_InitInternal
    VR_InitInternal2
    VR_IsHmdPresent
    VR_IsInterfaceVersionValid
    VR_IsRuntimeInstalled
    VR_RuntimePath
    VR_ShutdownInternal
    EyeCaptureProxyVersion
